1
00:00:00,362 --> 00:00:01,492
Pretty clear. Heh.

2
00:00:01,664 --> 00:00:04,224
(Bernadette:)Do I look like I feel better?

3
00:00:05,334 --> 00:00:08,494
(Howard:)I mean, it's not, like, HD quality.

4
00:00:09,171 --> 00:00:12,501
Listen, you're gonna talk to your mother
and you're gonna fix this.

5
00:00:12,675 --> 00:00:15,615
(Bernadette:)Or that thing I said I was gonna do to you
when you got home...

6
00:00:15,811 --> 00:00:18,181
(Bernadette:)...you can do to yourself.

7
00:00:20,516 --> 00:00:23,546
(Dimitri:)Like he's been doing since he got here.

8
00:00:28,858 --> 00:00:31,918
(Amy:)Sheldon, this place is so romantic.

9
00:00:32,094 --> 00:00:35,034
Aw... I'm glad you like it. Raj picked it out.

10
00:00:36,832 --> 00:00:38,962
(Amy:)When you see him,
tell him I say thank you.

11
00:00:39,134 --> 00:00:40,624
(Sheldon:)Tell him yourself.

12
00:00:41,537 --> 00:00:44,027
(Raj:)Yoo-hoo! Over here.

13
00:00:46,208 --> 00:00:48,578
(Amy:)I don't understand. What's he doing here?

14
00:00:48,744 --> 00:00:51,874
- I invited him.
- On our date?

15
00:00:52,047 --> 00:00:53,637
(Amy:)Sheldon, that's not okay.

16
00:00:53,816 --> 00:00:58,216
Oh. Yes, it is. There's a loophole
in the relationship agreement.

